<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-5869] Unexpected timeout exception while client connecting with different BinaryConfiguration compactFooter param.</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-5869</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;While client connecting with different from cluster BinaryConfiguration::setCompactFooter param, instead of expecting: &quot;configuration is not equal&quot; exception catch: Join process timed out exception.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
