                            <comment id="16106906" author="dsetrakyan" created="Mon, 31 Jul 2017 07:33:01 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Is Ignite supposed to work with different compactFooter configurations in the cluster? If not, why do we even allow for such clients to connect?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16107146" author="zstan" created="Mon, 31 Jul 2017 11:10:28 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Dmitry, no, different config must lead into: &quot;configuration is not equal to remote node&apos;s binary configuration&quot; Exception, but sometimes we got timeout exception.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
